fixture hazard_respawn_drops_stale_jump
doc (movement review 4, M2) a jump pressed in the air over the spikes, with the air jump already spent, three ticks before the hazard (frame 61). The send-back keeps the input buffer, so that press, made over the pit, fires on the first tick at the respawn point (frame 62, a full ground jump) and, with the stick still held right, carries Ash back out over the edge by frame 69.
room test/spike_chasm
spawn 300 384
frames 120
input
  0..30 R
  31 R jump
  32..57 R
  58 R jump
  59..119 R
end
expect
  at 31 event.air_jump=1
  mark die 30..70 event.hazard=1
  # The jump press at 42 is the stale one; nothing pressed after the respawn.
  never die+1..die+10 event.jump=1
end
